+# Generate m18 L18B b03 approval flow scene asset
+
+## Goal
+
+Generate the requested course scene PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-18-lesson18B/m18_L18B_b03_approval-flow.png`.
+
+## Scope
+
+- Use the supplied BMH course doodle style references and cast-board character style.
+- Create one PNG at 1600 x 900.
+- Show an outbound approval flow on a plain cornflower-blue field.
+- Place a blank county-channel pane with one blank draft message card on the left.
+- Place one manager character at a simple review desk in the center, calmly reviewing the blank card with a pen.
+- Place two blank outbound-tool tiles on the right, represented as generic rounded rectangles with small blank device and mail shapes.
+- Move a simple path of blank cards left to right from draft to review to send.
+- Leave the upper third open for later code-rendered labels.
+- Use only the locked palette: cornflower-blue background, yellow, orange, cream, white, and black.
+- Avoid all text, labels, numbers, logos, real app marks, readable messages, decorative clutter, motion marks, gradients, shadows, lighting, texture, and perspective.
+
+## Verification
+
+- Confirm the file exists at the requested path.
+- Confirm the file is PNG and 1600 x 900.
+- Confirm palette is flat and close to the locked course colors.
+- Visually inspect for exactly one person, correct left-center-right approval layout, blank panes and cards, no baked text/logos, no decorative filler, and open upper-third blue space for overlays.

